{"id":"dedans","lemma":"dedans","pos":"prep","rank":591,"glosses":["inside, in, within"],"ipa":"/də.dɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cb/Fr-dedans.ogg/Fr-dedans.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Est-ce là-dedans ?","en":"Is it in there?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Que font-ils exactement, là-dedans ?","en":"What exactly are they doing in there?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"exactly, quite"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Elles sont toutes là-dedans.","en":"They're all in there.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Je ne vais pas aller là-dedans.","en":"I'm not going to go in there.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Nous pouvons nous cacher là-dedans.","en":"We can hide in here.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to hide"},{"g":"there"},null]}]}